Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:19.19,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}羽ばたいた鳥の群れに
