Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:42.88,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}変わらないもの　ぼくらのただいまの場所
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:48.43,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}いつか夢の続きを聞かせてよ
